      "created_at": "2015-01-26T14:19:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I'm imagining different formats. &nbsp; One where you can take any available characters but that is your team for the entire tourney. &nbsp;Another having drafts that include only characters from specific sets which makes banning still effective.&nbsp;</p>",
