      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/{size}/1897_2.png",
      "created_at": "2015-01-27T01:24:14.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Bans and drafts work better with more characters.</p><p>When the number gets high enough that it is right, you add a second ban.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>More than two bans is too much. &nbsp;4 characters out of the match is a lot.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Also the Bans are not so much about taking out a few really good characters, but gambling on getting a team that can be countered by the characters you ban, and hoping the other team doesn't ruin it with their bans and picks.</p>",
